l</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">350</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">300</span> and  /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">300</span> </div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Hell Hub 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"188\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hell_Hub_1_f6f29d.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ferumbras Ascension Quest 02\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"142\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ferumbras_Ascension_Quest_02_a71039.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.90<br/>December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Hell Hub</b> is a dungeon that connects seven locations which are realms of <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Ruthless%20Seven\">T